Dialogue: 3,0:00:00.00,0:01:00.00,T1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)}O SALMO 23 EM INGLÊS
Dialogue: 3,0:00:00.00,0:01:00.00,T2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)}Comigo, em 1 minuto.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.20,0:00:02.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}É UM MINUTO.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.20,0:00:02.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}IT'S ONE MINUTE.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.60,0:00:05.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}EM UM MINUTO VOCÊ VAI SABER\NO SALMO 23 EM INGLÊS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.60,0:00:05.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}IN ONE MINUTE YOU'LL KNOW PSALM 23 IN ENGLISH
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.20,0:00:08.25,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}The Lord is my shepherd,\NI lack nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.20,0:00:08.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}O Senhor é o meu pastor, nada me faltará.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.40,0:00:10.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}He makes me lie down\Nin green pastures,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.40,0:00:10.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}Ele me faz repousar em pastos verdejantes,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}he leads me beside\Nquiet waters,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}me leva para junto de águas tranquilas,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}he refreshes my soul.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}restaura a minha alma.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.00,0:00:16.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}He guides me along\Nthe right paths.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.00,0:00:16.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}Ele me guia pelos caminhos certos.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}Even though I walk through\Nthe darkest valley,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}Mesmo que eu ande pelo vale mais escuro,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}I will fear no evil,\Nfor you are with me;
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}não temerei mal algum, pois tu estás comigo;
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.20,0:00:23.90,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}your rod and your staff,\Nthey comfort me.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.20,0:00:23.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}a tua vara e o teu cajado me consolam.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.20,0:00:28.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}You prepare a table before me\Nin the presence of my enemies.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.20,0:00:28.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}Preparas uma mesa para mim\Nna presença dos meus inimigos.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}You anoint my head with oil;
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}Unges a minha cabeça com óleo;
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.60,0:00:32.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}my cup overflows.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.60,0:00:32.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}o meu cálice transborda.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}Surely your goodness\Nand love
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}Certamente a tua bondade e o teu amor
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}will follow me all\Nthe days of my life,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}me seguirão todos os dias da minha vida,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.00,0:00:40.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}and I will dwell in the house\Nof the Lord forever.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.00,0:00:40.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}e habitarei na casa do Senhor para sempre.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.96,0:00:43.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}E ME SIGA
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.96,0:00:43.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}FOLLOW ME
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.01,0:00:44.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}SE QUISER APRENDER
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.01,0:00:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}IF YOU WANT TO LEARN
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.16,0:00:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1430)\fad(60,40)}MAIS PALAVRAS EM INGLÊS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.16,0:00:46.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1455)\fad(60,40)}MORE ENGLISH WORDS
